[node name="RoomWaterG" type="Node2D" unique_id=1840849303]
editor_description = "Re-planned ice: frozen water HANGS where it froze (no momentum). The snake is a TRAIL (1 in water, hold 3 and lift): it lies exactly along the ball's path, snapped to 22.5 degree runs; steer back over it to rewind it. Draw a slide over the spike pit and freeze it (2). Freeze a thrown ball by the ledge as a step. Freeze the pool (crystal: 2 aimed at it), freeze a ball on it and gust it (Z): pucks slide on ice until something stops them; open the door with the plate."
